{"about":["In Vlad Circus: Descend into Madness, discover a story full of mystery and pain where every shadow hides a twisted secret or vicious threat, and no one is safe from tragedy.","Experience the chilling story of a 1920s freak circus that burned to the ground, and the grotesque quest to found the circus anew. Follow the tormented Oliver Mills as he struggles to survive and escape.","Fall into the evocative pixel art, envelop yourself in the all-encompassing sound, and be enthralled by rich dialogue.","● A twisting, psychological horror tale with an unforgettable ending","● Puzzle-solving elements and survival mechanics","● A labyrinthine mansion of over 50 locations","● Enchanting pixel art and dazzling 2D lighting system","Offline single player","Uses DUALSHOCK 4 vibration function","Software subject to license (us.playstation.com/softwarelicense)."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202208/0303/CT25lsvNGP4CHAdOjEs7J7br.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202208/0303/CT25lsvNGP4CHAdOjEs7J7br.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202307/2523/4ab6d895b43b2b95d01a5c6c18a1d75280d4cc14cfdb8bfb.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202307/2523/4ab6d895b43b2b95d01a5c6c18a1d75280d4cc14cfdb8bfb.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202208/0303/Lf4AmwTOW6D4bAPDYazJmyQM.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202208/0303/Lf4AmwTOW6D4bAPDYazJmyQM.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202208/0303/SAcLhGX70Hva7GXp8Sd6u2B9.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202208/0303/SAcLhGX70Hva7GXp8Sd6u2B9.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202208/0303/xXH6keitMytdc549NYeBsP9O.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https: